                  "headline": "Small to mid sized options in the morning, get in before the high tide ",
                  "observation": "Size backs down, with some ok options early but the dropping swell will be easily swallowed up by the rush towards a 2.3m tide. Morning wind also best, light offshore for Bukit reefs and also a chance for the dawnie on the east side. Shoulder maybe bigger on the outer reefs, much smaller everywhere else. ",
