                  "headline": "Small to mid sized surf around. Lift in size/energy late in day as long period forerunners show. ",
                  "observation": "Initial lift in size on the outer corners of the Bukit and other south swell magnets - these possibly chest to head high. Not as much size getting into sheltered zones. Note a small increase in size and energy late afternoon as long period SSW swell comes in. Expect some better shape on exposed reefs especially as tide drains out later in the day. Some lump n bump to waves later on, after a cleaner start to the day, but still worth a grovel. ",
